<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC elects Qatar oil minister new President.</title>
<headline>OPEC elects Qatar oil minister new President.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC minsters meeting on Thursday elected Qatar's oil minister Abdullah bin Hamad Al Attiyah president for the six months from July 1, an OPEC official said.  </p>
<p>Indonesia's oil minister Ida Bagus Sudjana was elected alternate President for the same period, the official added.</p>
<p>- Vienna newsroom, +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
